TEXT -64 -560 Left 2 ;06  FULL SIGNAL CHAIN  (transient)  code -> DAC -> I-to-V -> filter -> ADG719 -> summer -> BNC\n;Pick the waveform: set ONE of Ksin / Ksq / Ktri to 1.  Square: also set SWSEL=1 (bypass the filter).\n;Vpk = output peak at OUT_DRV (max ~5.3 V). Voff = DC offset in volts (sets OFF_BUF directly;\n;04_offset_pwm.asc checks the PWM/RC path that makes OFF_BUF on the board). RL = load on the BNC.\n;Low f runs slowly (the run covers 4 periods at 10 ns steps).
