TEXT -64 960 Left 2 !.lib fg_models.lib\n.tran 0 {4/f} {2/f} 10n\n.param f=10k fs=2Meg Vpk=5 Ksin=1 Ksq=0 Ktri=0 SWSEL=0 Voff=0 RL=1k\n.func PH(t) {f*floor(t*fs)/fs-floor(f*floor(t*fs)/fs)}\n.func SHAPE(p) {Ksin*sin(6.28318531*p)+Ksq*sgn(0.5-p)+Ktri*(1-4*abs(p-0.5))}\n.meas TRAN bnc_max MAX V(BNC)\n.meas TRAN bnc_min MIN V(BNC)\n.meas TRAN drv_max MAX V(OUT_DRV)\n.meas TRAN drv_min MIN V(OUT_DRV)\n.meas TRAN bnc_avg AVG V(BNC)\n.meas TRAN sum_max MAX V(SUM_SIG)\n.meas TRAN sum_min MIN V(SUM_SIG)\n.meas TRAN t_edge TRIG V(BNC)=-3.7 RISE=1 TARG V(BNC)=3.7 RISE=1
TEXT -64 1400 Left 1 ;Probe these on the bench at the same names: DAC_OUT, FILT_OUT, SUM_SIG, OFF_BUF, OUT_DRV, BNC.\n;t_edge = BNC rise time -3.7 V -> +3.7 V (meaningful for square only). Expected values: README.md table T6.
